# Normalise line endings so the repository is identical on Windows, macOS and
# the Linux CI runner. Without this, files authored on Windows arrive with CRLF
# and shell scripts inside workflows fail in ways that look like flakes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary

# Frozen research inputs are hashed byte for byte (a labelled set's sha256
# names every run over it), so git stores them exactly as written.
wp/wp-8/**/*.jsonl -text
